<phrase>
  id: LANG_SOLITAIRE_HELP_MOVE
  desc: in Solitaire's Help, the second paragraph: moving the cursor. ◀ and ▶ are the iPod's Previous and Next buttons, kept as these signs; the wheel is the click wheel
  user: extras
  <source>
    *: "◀ and ▶ move between the columns; past the first or the last one, they go to the turned card beside the deck. The wheel moves up and down a column, and along the top row between the turned card and the four piles."
  </source>
  <dest>
    *: "◀ og ▶ flytter mellem kolonnerne; forbi den første eller den sidste går de til det vendte kort ved siden af stakken. Hjulet flytter op og ned i en kolonne og i den øverste række mellem det vendte kort og de fire bunker."
  </dest>
  <voice>
    *: ""
  </voice>
</phrase>
<phrase>
  id: LANG_SOLITAIRE_HELP_SELECT
  desc: in Solitaire's Help, the third paragraph: moving cards. Select and Menu are the iPod's buttons of those names, as the iPod's manual in your language names them
  user: extras
  <source>
    *: "Select picks up the card under the cursor. Select on another column or pile moves it there with the cards on it, or puts it back if it can't go there. Select on the same card again sends it to its pile if it fits. Menu also puts back a card picked up."
  </source>
  <dest>
    *: "Select tager kortet under markøren op. Select på en anden kolonne eller bunke flytter det derhen med kortene oven på det, eller lægger det tilbage, hvis det ikke kan ligge der. Select på det samme kort igen sender det til dets bunke, hvis det passer. Menu lægger også et kort, der er taget op, tilbage."
  </dest>
  <voice>
    *: ""
  </voice>
</phrase>
<phrase>
  id: LANG_SOLITAIRE_HELP_SHORTCUTS
  desc: in Solitaire's Help, the last paragraph: the buttons held. Play, Menu and Select are the iPod's buttons, ▶ its Next button kept as this sign; the turned card is the face-up card beside the deck at the top left
  user: extras
  <source>
    *: "Play puts the turned card where the cursor is. Hold ▶ to send the turned card to its pile, or hold Menu to send the card under the cursor to its pile. Hold Select for the menu."
  </source>
  <dest>
    *: "Play lægger det vendte kort, hvor markøren er. Hold ▶ nede for at sende det vendte kort til dets bunke, eller hold Menu nede for at sende kortet under markøren til dets bunke. Hold Select nede for menuen."
  </dest>
  <voice>
    *: ""
  </voice>
</phrase>
